{"id":"e4ed3aef037b32e0","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-occam-learning.md","title":"Finite Hypothesis Class Generalization","display":"thm-occam-learning — Finite Hypothesis Class Generalization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-occam-learning","aliases":["28-thm-occam-learning","Finite-Class Occam Bound"],"display":"thm-occam-learning — Finite Hypothesis Class Generalization","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, p.59 footnote 7 learning note; local finite-class union-bound proof","source_printed_pages":"59","source_pdf_pages":"85","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed","source_reference_before_R6":"p.66 learning note; printed 66 / PDF 92"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-occam-learning"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-occam-learning</span><span>Finite-Class Occam Bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-occam-learning — Finite Hypothesis Class Generalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, p.59 footnote 7 learning note; local finite-class union-bound proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"59"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"85"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference_before_R6","html":"p.66 learning note; printed 66 / PDF 92"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D:X\\to[0,1]\">\\(D:X\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{x\\in X}D(x)=1\">\\(\\sum_{x\\in X}D(x)=1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^X\">\\(\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^X\\)</span> 为有限非空类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathcal H\">\\(c\\in\\mathcal H\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\">\\([m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{c,m}\">\\(\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_c\">\\(s_c\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{err}_D\">\\(\\operatorname{err}_D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}\">\\(\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}\\)</span> 由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\\in X^m\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\\in X^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in\\mathcal H\">\\(h\\in\\mathcal H\\)</span>；空乘积为一。</li>\n<li>随机学习器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的输出由有限随机核 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_A:\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\times\\mathcal H\\to[0,1]\">\\(K_A:\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\times\\mathcal H\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 指定，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\;\\sum_{h\\in\\mathcal H}K_A(s,h)=1\">\\(\\forall s\\in\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\;\\sum_{h\\in\\mathcal H}K_A(s,h)=1\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x\\in X^m\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(K_A(s_c(\\vec x),h)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\forall i\\in[m]\\;h(x_i)=c(x_i)\\bigr)\">\\(\\forall\\vec x\\in X^m\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(K_A(s_c(\\vec x),h)&gt;0\\Rightarrow\\forall i\\in[m]\\;h(x_i)=c(x_i)\\bigr)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_A(s,h)\">\\(K_A(s,h)\\)</span> 是给定完整有标记样本 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 时输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 的条件概率；确定型学习器对应每行恰有一个值为一的随机核。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon,\\delta\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\varepsilon,\\delta\\in(0,1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\">\\(\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\)</span> 取独立同分布样本与上述条件输出的联合概率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_c(\\vec x)\\coloneqq((x_i,c(x_i)))_{i=1}^m,\\qquad\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\coloneqq\\{s_c(\\vec x):\\vec x\\in X^m\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_c(\\vec x)\\coloneqq((x_i,c(x_i)))_{i=1}^m,\\qquad\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\coloneqq\\{s_c(\\vec x):\\vec x\\in X^m\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in X}D(x)\\mathbf1[h(x)\\ne c(x)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in X}D(x)\\mathbf1[h(x)\\ne c(x)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\vec x\\in X^m}\\left(\\prod_{i=1}^m D(x_i)\\right)\\sum_{\\substack{h\\in\\mathcal H\\\\\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)&gt;\\varepsilon}}K_A(s_c(\\vec x),h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\vec x\\in X^m}\\left(\\prod_{i=1}^m D(x_i)\\right)\\sum_{\\substack{h\\in\\mathcal H\\\\\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)&gt;\\varepsilon}}K_A(s_c(\\vec x),h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\le|\\mathcal H|(1-\\varepsilon)^m\\le|\\mathcal H|e^{-\\varepsilon m}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\le|\\mathcal H|(1-\\varepsilon)^m\\le|\\mathcal H|e^{-\\varepsilon m}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m\\ge\\frac{\\ln|\\mathcal H|+\\ln(1/\\delta)}{\\varepsilon}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\le\\delta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m\\ge\\frac{\\ln|\\mathcal H|+\\ln(1/\\delta)}{\\varepsilon}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\le\\delta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>对每个坏假设 h，全部 m 个样本均与它一致的概率为 (1−err_D(h,c))<sup>m≤(1−ε)</sup>m。对有限 H 用并合界，任何一致学习器输出坏假设的事件均包含在上述并集内；学习器的额外随机性不影响此包含。代入 m 界得到第二式。这是完整本地概率证明。原书 p.59 脚注7仅有 Occam/Valiant 学习背景，未定位直接定理陈述，故不把本条标成原书已核验定理。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：p.59 footnote 7 learning note; local finite-class union-bound proof，印刷页 59；PDF 页 85。原书未定位到本条的完整直接陈述；这是与书中主题相关的本地补充。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>R6来源纠正：直接读取PDF92确认该页为习题，实际Occam/Valiant背景在印刷59/PDF85脚注7。已更正当前定位并保留旧定位字段；本地有限类并合界仍不是原书直接定理。</p>\n<p>本次接口修订：把随机学习器的输出法则和联合失败概率写为有限随机核及有限和，不再依赖未指定的“对算法随机性取概率”约定。样本一致性只限制随机核的支撑；不另加计算效率或随机位模型条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"D:X\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{x\\in X}D(x)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^X","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[m]=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S_{c,m}","display":false},{"tex":"s_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{err}_D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)\\in X^m","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"K_A:\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\times\\mathcal H\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s\\in\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\;\\sum_{h\\in\\mathcal H}K_A(s,h)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec x\\in X^m\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\bigl(K_A(s_c(\\vec x),h)>0\\Rightarrow\\forall i\\in[m]\\;h(x_i)=c(x_i)\\bigr)","display":false},{"tex":"K_A(s,h)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon,\\delta\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"s_c(\\vec x)\\coloneqq((x_i,c(x_i)))_{i=1}^m,\\qquad\\mathcal S_{c,m}\\coloneqq\\{s_c(\\vec x):\\vec x\\in X^m\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)\\coloneqq\\sum_{x\\in X}D(x)\\mathbf1[h(x)\\ne c(x)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\sum_{\\vec x\\in X^m}\\left(\\prod_{i=1}^m D(x_i)\\right)\\sum_{\\substack{h\\in\\mathcal H\\\\\\operatorname{err}_D(h,c)>\\varepsilon}}K_A(s_c(\\vec x),h).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\le|\\mathcal H|(1-\\varepsilon)^m\\le|\\mathcal H|e^{-\\varepsilon m}.","display":true},{"tex":"m\\ge\\frac{\\ln|\\mathcal H|+\\ln(1/\\delta)}{\\varepsilon}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Risk}_{D,c,A}(\\varepsilon)\\le\\delta.","display":true}],"bytes":3504,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"学习理论：[[28-df-pac-learning]]、[[28-df-vc-dimension]]、[[28-thm-occam-learning]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}